{
  "rationale": "The plant is split into two automata: one for perception (sensor outcomes) and one for motion (motion commands). The specification automata bind perception outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative obstacle recovery, and ensure full_rotate is only used as a last resort. The design ensures forward progress is prioritized, with conservative recovery and rapid return to exploration after obstacles.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate perception and motion into distinct plant automata for modularity.",
    "Specifications bind sensor outcomes to actions, enforce safe recovery, and prevent unsafe or oscillatory behaviors."
  ],
